    {id:'wa-dinnerly-saag',title:'Balanced tofu and spinach saag with lentils',type:'Dinner',time:35,image:'/assets/whatsapp/balanced-tofu-spinach-saag.jpg',desc:'A Dinnerly tofu saag with spinach, lentils and red rice.',note:'The curry is vegetarian and protein-rich from tofu and lentils. Serve red rice separately for a lower-carb plate.',tags:['vegetarian','high protein','dinner'],details:{ingredients:['125 g red rice','1 onion, chopped','2 tomatoes, chopped','400 g lentils, drained and rinsed','200 g peanut satay tofu','10 g masala seasoning','50 g baby spinach leaves','2 garlic cloves','1 tbsp vegetable oil','Salt and pepper','Optional chopped chilli or chilli flakes'],steps:['Cook the red rice in boiling water for about 25 minutes, or until tender. Drain.','Cut the tofu into 2 cm chunks and pan-sear in half the oil for about 2 minutes on each side. Remove from the pan.','Cook the onion in the remaining oil for 3 minutes. Add garlic and masala seasoning and cook for 1 minute.','Add the tomatoes and cook for 3 minutes. Add half the lentils and ¾ cup water; season and simmer for 8 minutes.','Stir in spinach and tofu and cook for 2–3 minutes, until the spinach wilts and tofu is warm. Serve with the rice.']}},
    {id:'wa-dinnerly-pork-pasta',title:'20-minute creamy coconut pork pasta',type:'Dinner',time:20,image:'/assets/whatsapp/creamy-coconut-pork-pasta.jpg',desc:'Coconut-milk pork pasta with a fresh tomato and spring onion salsa.',note:'For the vegetarian plate, use tofu or mushrooms in a separate pan and the same coconut-tomato sauce. Offer zucchini noodles or greens instead of pasta.',tags:['high protein','dinner'],details:{ingredients:['250 g spaghetti','200 g pork mince','200 ml coconut milk','2 tomatoes, chopped','1 spring onion, sliced','2 garlic cloves, crushed','10 g smoky barbecue seasoning','2 tbsp tomato paste','2 tsp red or white wine vinegar','1½ tbsp olive oil','2 tbsp barbecue sauce (optional)','Salt and pepper'],steps:['Bring salted water to a boil and cook the spaghetti until al dente. Drain.','Mix the green spring onion tops, 2 tbsp chopped tomato, vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil; season to make the salsa.','Brown the pork mince in a hot pan with a little oil for 3–4 minutes.','Add garlic, spring onion whites and remaining tomato. Cook for 3 minutes, then add barbecue seasoning and tomato paste.','Stir in coconut milk and ¼ cup water. Simmer for about 5 minutes until thickened.','Toss the sauce with the pasta. Serve with tomato salsa and optional barbecue sauce.']}},
    {id:'wa-dylan-spaghetti',title:'Dylan’s egg and cheese spaghetti with zucchini and mushrooms',type:'Dinner',time:20,image:'photo-1473093295043-cdd812d0e601',desc:'A quick family pasta with an egg, cheese and milk sauce, zucchini and crisp mushrooms.',note:'Keep some vegetables aside for the kids to add themselves. The protein-focused adult can have a smaller spaghetti portion with extra egg, tofu or greens.',tags:['vegetarian','high protein','dinner'],details:{ingredients:['Spaghetti, cooked and still warm','¾ cup grated cheese','A splash of milk','2 eggs','Zucchini, sliced','Mushrooms, sliced','Oil, salt and pepper'],steps:['Whisk the cheese, milk and eggs together and set aside.','Fry the zucchini and mushrooms separately until tender; cook the mushrooms until crisp if desired.','Mix the warm spaghetti with the egg and cheese sauce. Stir in half the vegetables and keep the rest for toppings.','Cook over medium heat, stirring, until the egg is just cooked but still glossy. Serve immediately.']}},
    {id:'wa-stuffed-sweet-potato-cream',title:'Creamy mushroom and spinach stuffed sweet potatoes',type:'Dinner',image:'/assets/whatsapp/mushroom-spinach-stuffed-sweet-potato.jpg',desc:'Sweet potatoes filled with mushrooms, spinach and a creamy cheese mixture.',note:'The WhatsApp screenshot shows steps 5–9 only. It says to bake the potatoes first, fill them, then return them to the oven for 10 minutes; check the original post for the missing early steps.',tags:['vegetarian','dinner'],details:{ingredients:['Sweet potatoes','Mushrooms, cooked','Spinach, cooked','Cream cheese','Grated cheese','Milk','Salt and pepper'],steps:['The screenshot begins at step 5: mix the cooked mushrooms and spinach with cream cheese, grated cheese and milk; season with salt and pepper.','Once the sweet potatoes are cooked, let them cool slightly and slice them open.','Spoon the filling into each potato half. Add extra cheese if desired.','Return to the oven for about 10 minutes, until warmed through and the cheese has melted.']}},
    {id:'wa-stuffed-sweet-potato-feta',title:'Spinach, mushroom and feta stuffed sweet potatoes',type:'Dinner',image:'/assets/whatsapp/stuffed-sweet-potatoes-feta.jpg',desc:'Baked sweet potatoes topped with garlicky spinach, mushrooms, rosemary and feta.',note:'Ingredients were visible in the WhatsApp image, but the cooking method was not. Use the linked post to confirm the original instructions.',tags:['vegetarian','dinner'],url:'https://www.facebook.com/share/p/1BcpVA9Fdy/',details:{ingredients:['4 medium sweet potatoes','1 tbsp olive oil','2 cups baby spinach, roughly chopped','1 cup mushrooms, sliced','1 garlic clove, minced','½ tsp fresh rosemary, finely chopped','½ cup crumbled feta','Salt and black pepper'],steps:['The WhatsApp image included ingredients and a finished photo but no cooking steps. Open the shared post for the method.']}},
    {id:'wa-beef-cabbage-stirfry',title:'Savory beef stir-fry with cabbage and garlic soy glaze',type:'Dinner',image:'/assets/whatsapp/beef-cabbage-stir-fry.jpg',desc:'Thin-sliced beef and cabbage with ginger, garlic, soy and oyster sauce.',note:'The screenshot showed ingredients but not the cooking method. For a vegetarian plate, replace beef and oyster sauce with tofu and vegetarian stir-fry sauce.',tags:['high protein','dinner'],url:'https://www.facebook.com/share/p/1JojDqeJUG/',details:{ingredients:['450 g beef sirloin, thinly sliced','4 cups green cabbage, shredded','1 tbsp sesame oil','2 tbsp vegetable oil','3 garlic cloves, minced','1 tbsp fresh ginger, minced','1 tbsp soy sauce','1 tbsp oyster sauce','1 tsp rice vinegar'],steps:['The WhatsApp image included ingredients but not the cooking steps. Open the shared post for the original method.']}},
    {id:'wa-cauliflower-broccoli-mac',title:'Cauliflower and broccoli mac and cheese',type:'Dinner',image:'/assets/whatsapp/cauliflower-broccoli-mac-cheese.jpg',desc:'A family-bake version of macaroni cheese with broccoli and cauliflower.',note:'Serve extra broccoli and cauliflower beside a smaller pasta portion for the protein-focused adult; add tofu or chicken separately if needed.',tags:['vegetarian','dinner'],details:{ingredients:['Macaroni pasta','Broccoli and cauliflower (the handwritten note says 2 kg; adjust to your dish size)','1 cup grated cheese, plus extra for the top','1 cup plain flour','½ cup oil','Milk (quantity is unclear in the photo)','2 tbsp vegetable stock','1 tsp paprika','1 tsp garlic'],steps:['Heat the oven to 180°C. Cook macaroni until al dente, adding broccoli and cauliflower for the last 3 minutes. Drain.','Warm the oil in a saucepan. Stir in flour over low heat to make a smooth paste.','Gradually stir in milk until thickened. Add paprika, garlic and vegetable stock, then cook over low heat for 5 minutes.','Fold the sauce through the pasta and vegetables. Stir in 1 cup cheese.','Transfer to baking dishes, top with extra cheese and bake until golden.']}},
    {id:'wa-tomato-burrata-gnocchi',title:'Creamy tomato gnocchi with burrata and basil',type:'Dinner',image:'/assets/whatsapp/tomato-burrata-gnocchi.jpg',desc:'A tomato-rich gnocchi dish finished with cream, basil and fresh burrata.',note:'The WhatsApp screenshot showed only part of the ingredient list and a photo; the method and complete quantities were not included.',tags:['vegetarian','dinner'],details:{ingredients:['Gnocchi','Cherry tomatoes','¼ cup extra-virgin olive oil','½ cup heavy cream','½ cup fresh basil, sliced or torn','2 (4-ounce) balls fresh burrata cheese'],steps:['The WhatsApp screenshot included only a partial ingredient list. Open the source post or add the missing method before cooking.']}}
